Alphabet Loaf.

A loop: counts down from C to A, one letter a turn, and serves them in order.

Ingredients.
3 g flour
1 g sugar
67 ml letters

Method.
Bake the flour. Put letters into the mixing bowl. Put letters into the mixing bowl. Remove sugar. Fold letters into the mixing bowl. Bake the flour until baked. Pour contents of the mixing bowl into the baking dish.

Serves 1.
